# Node: atomic — C* nonzero complex carrier
# Run: litex -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_rule/standard_set_c_star.lit
#
# When: `have z C*` / membership facts about C*.
# After: C* members are in C and nonzero; 0 is not in C*.

have z C*
z $in C
z != 0
i $in C*
1 $in C*
not 0 $in C*
R* $subset C*
C* $subset C
